    "introHtml": "<p>Refreshed <strong>Aug 2, 2026</strong>. Cars.com: <strong>13</strong> qualifying listings (24 total, filters: clean title + no accidents). CarGurus: <strong>12</strong> qualifying listings (65 total, page 1 of 4 \u2014 pagination is session-based). AutoTrader: <strong>19</strong> qualifying listings (37+39 raw across 2 pages). TrueCar: skipped (broken body-style filter). Excluded this run: 2-seat roadsters (Miata, Boxster, Z3/Z4, SL-Class, Solstice, Crossfire, Audi TT Roadster, Ford Thunderbird 2002\u20132005 retro), plus owner preferences (MINI, Buick, Camry Solara, Camaro, pre-2005 Mustang, Volvo, Cadillac Allante). No manuals confirmed \u2014 lone manual candidate (Audi TT) excluded as 2-seat roadster.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
