        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/07/12/06/37/2009_mercedes-benz_clk-pic-5147648557516517479-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "CLK350 Cabriolet is a proper 4-seat W209 Mercedes \u2014 elegant folding soft top, 268 hp V6, and only 65k miles puts it well under the typical wear threshold. Two miles from Media makes a pre-purchase inspection a lunch errand.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top-cycle test (raise/lower 3x \u2014 listen for hydraulic groans); headliner and carpet for water staining behind rear seats; rear-window plastic clarity and seam integrity; rocker panel rust inspection; balance shaft chain rattle on cold start (3.5L M272).",
        "bottomLine": "Low-mileage CLK350 practically in your driveway \u2014 hardest part is talking yourself out of it."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2010,
        "make": "Lexus",
        "model": "IS 250C",
        "trim": "Retractable Hardtop",
        "price": 12000,
