        "whyGood": "Lexus IS 250C has one of the most reliable retractable hardtops in the segment \u2014 electrically operated metal roof means no fabric worries. 91k miles is mid-life for a Lexus, and the 2.5L V6 is bulletproof. Private seller avoids dealer markup.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full hardtop cycle (open/close 3x); trunk-space sensor operation; headliner and seat bolster wear; transmission fluid condition; rear-deck weatherstrip seal for water intrusion; brake condition (often neglected on part-time fun cars).",
        "bottomLine": "Best long-term reliability pick in the batch \u2014 Lexus hardtop tops barely fail, unlike fabric."
      },
      {
