        "whyGood": "E64 650i at 44,625 miles is a genuine find \u2014 these V8 grand tourers routinely double that when maintained. Clean title, no accidents, private sale from one owner. 367 hp 4.8L N62 V8 with a proper soft-top that takes 25 seconds to stow.",
