        "whyGood": "B6 S4 Cabriolet is one of the rarest bodystyles at this price \u2014 it got the 4.2L V8 in B6, but the B7 S4 (this 2006) has the 4.2 FSI. Clean title and no accidents at $7,204 is exceptional value. Quattro means four-season use.",
